  "body": "Key Features:\r\n-Existing three-bedroom home\r\n-Concept plans available for a stunning 268sqm (approx.) five-bedroom residence\r\n-607sqm (more or less) freehold site\r\n-Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban zoning\r\n-Elevated site enjoying excellent sun\r\n-Water and wastewater infrastructure nearby\r\n-Close to Waiake Beach, Long Bay Regional Park and Browns Bay\r\n-Offered on an \"as is, where is\" basis\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure freehold land in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs are becoming increasingly scarce. Positioned on an elevated 607sqm (more or less) site in sought-after Waiake, this property offers builders, developers, investors and visionaries the chance to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal, concept plans have already been prepared for a striking two-level residence of approximately 268sqm, showcasing a contemporary five-bedroom family home with multiple living areas, a double internal access garage, expansive outdoor entertaining and a generous master suite. Whether you choose to pursue this vision (subject to council approval) or explore your own design, the groundwork has already begun.\r\n\r\nThe existing three-bedroom home provides flexibility while you complete your own investigations. Renovate, rebuild or landbank for the future - the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nLocation is where this opportunity truly shines. Just minutes from the golden sands of Waiake Beach, Long Bay Regional Park, Browns Bay village, quality schools and excellent transport connections, you'll be investing in a tightly held coastal community that continues to experience strong demand.\r\n\r\nBeing offered on an \"as is, where is\" basis, this property will appeal to purchasers who recognise the long-term value of premium land and have the vision to unlock its full potential.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this rare opportunity to secure a foothold in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nConcept plans are indicative only and purchasers should complete their own due diligence and obtain all necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nFor concept plans and further information please copy & paste this into your url: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XXM6",
